Good. Now I understand the task. Let me implement the transpose function.

The logic:
- Input is text with rows (lines). Think of it as a matrix.
- Transpose: rows become columns, columns become rows.
- Left-pad with spaces for ragged inputs (shorter rows pad on left).
- Don't right-pad (truncating columns).
